From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ncrypt: PKCS #8 private key blobs, plain and under a secret

ncrypt: PKCS #8 private key blobs, plain and under a secret

NCryptExportKey and NCryptImportKey handle NCRYPT_PKCS8_PRIVATE_KEY_BLOB for
RSA keys: a PrivateKeyInfo, or with NCRYPTBUFFER_PKCS_SECRET an
EncryptedPrivateKeyInfo using PBES2 (PBKDF2 with HMAC-SHA256, AES in CBC mode).
---
